{"seq":3,"slug":"headless-components","title":"无头组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/headless-components","wordCount":740,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"无头组件\">无头组件</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无头组件（Headless Components）只提供逻辑与状态，不附带任何 UI 样式，把「做什么」与「看起来怎样」彻底分离，让使用者拥有完全的样式自由。它通常以 Logic-Only Hook 加 props getter 的形式出现，或由 Radix UI 这类库以可组合组件的形式提供，并内置焦点管理、键盘导航、ARIA 等无障碍能力。本章讲解无头组件的定义、Logic-Only Hooks 的用法、Radix UI 模式，以及无障碍与样式自由两方面的收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是无头组件\">什么是无头组件</h2><p><strong>无头组件（Headless Components）</strong> 是只提供逻辑和状态管理、不包含任何 UI 样式的组件模式。它将&quot;做什么&quot;和&quot;看起来怎样&quot;完全分离，让使用者拥有完全的样式自由。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 传统组件&#10;        A[逻辑 + 状态] --&gt; B[固定样式]&#10;        B --&gt; C[有限的定制]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 无头组件&#10;        D[逻辑 + 状态] --&gt; E[使用者自定义样式]&#10;        D --&gt; F[使用者自定义结构]&#10;        D --&gt; G[内置无障碍支持]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 传统组件\n        A[逻辑 + 状态] --&gt; B[固定样式]\n        B --&gt; C[有限的定制]\n    end\n    subgraph 无头组件\n        D[逻辑 + 状态] --&gt; E[使用者自定义样式]\n        D --&gt; F[使用者自定义结构]\n        D --&gt; G[内置无障碍支持]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>传统 UI 库</th>\n<th>无头组件库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>样式</td>\n<td>内置（可覆盖）</td>\n<td>不提供</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTML 结构</td>\n<td>固定</td>\n<td>使用者决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍</td>\n<td>通常内置</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制程度</td>\n<td>中（主题系统）</td>\n<td>完全自由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表</td>\n<td>Ant Design, MUI</td>\n<td>Radix UI, Headless UI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"logic-only-hooks\">Logic-Only Hooks</h2><p>最简单的无头组件形式是纯逻辑 Hook。它管理状态和行为，返回 props getter 让使用者绑定到任意元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface UseToggleReturn {&#10;  isOpen: boolean;&#10;  open: () =&gt; void;&#10;  close: () =&gt; void;&#10;  toggle: () =&gt; void;&#10;  getToggleProps: (&#10;    props?: React.ButtonHTMLAttributes&lt;HTMLButtonElement&gt;,&#10;  ) =&gt; React.ButtonHTMLAttributes&lt;HTMLButtonElement&gt;;&#10;  getContentProps: () =&gt; React.HTMLAttributes&lt;HTMLElement&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function useToggle(defaultOpen = false): UseToggleReturn {&#10;  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(defaultOpen);&#10;  const id = useId();&#10;&#10;  const open = useCallback(() =&gt; setIsOpen(true), []);&#10;  const close = useCallback(() =&gt; setIsOpen(false), []);&#10;  const toggle = useCallback(() =&gt; setIsOpen((v) =&gt; !v), []);&#10;&#10;  const getToggleProps = useCallback(&#10;    (props: React.ButtonHTMLAttributes&lt;HTMLButtonElement&gt; = {}) =&gt; ({&#10;      ...props,&#10;      &#39;aria-expanded&#39;: isOpen,&#10;      &#39;aria-controls&#39;: id,&#10;      onClick: (e: React.MouseEvent&lt;HTMLButtonElement&gt;) =&gt; {&#10;        props.onClick?.(e);&#10;        toggle();&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;    [isOpen, id, toggle],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  const getContentProps = useCallback(&#10;    () =&gt; ({&#10;      id,&#10;      role: &#39;region&#39; as const,&#10;      hidden: !isOpen,&#10;    }),&#10;    [id, isOpen],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return { isOpen, open, close, toggle, getToggleProps, getContentProps };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface UseToggleReturn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  isOpen: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  open: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  close: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  toggle: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  getToggleProps: (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    props?: React.ButtonHTMLAttributes&#x3C;HTMLButtonElement>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) => React.ButtonHTMLAttributes&#x3C;HTMLButtonElement>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  getContentProps: () => React.HTMLAttributes&#x3C;HTMLElement>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function useToggle(defaultOpen = false): UseToggleReturn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(defaultOpen);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const id = useId();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const open = useCallback(() => setIsOpen(true), []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const close = useCallback(() => setIsOpen(false), []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const toggle = useCallback(() => setIsOpen((v) => !v), []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const getToggleProps = useCallback(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (props: React.ButtonHTMLAttributes&#x3C;HTMLButtonElement> = {}) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ...props,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      'aria-expanded': isOpen,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      'aria-controls': id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onClick: (e: React.MouseEvent&#x3C;HTMLButtonElement>) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        props.onClick?.(e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        toggle();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [isOpen, id, toggle],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const getContentProps = useCallback(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      role: 'region' as const,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      hidden: !isOpen,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [id, isOpen],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return { isOpen, open, close, toggle, getToggleProps, getContentProps };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用方式\">使用方式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function FAQ({ question, answer }: { question: string; answer: string }) {&#10;  const { isOpen, getToggleProps, getContentProps } = useToggle();&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;faq-item&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;button {...getToggleProps({ className: &#39;faq-question&#39; })}&gt;&#10;        {question} {isOpen ? &#39;−&#39; : &#39;+&#39;}&#10;      &lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;div {...getContentProps()} className=&quot;faq-answer&quot;&gt;&#10;        {answer}&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function FAQ({ question, answer }: { question: string; answer: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { isOpen, getToggleProps, getContentProps } = useToggle();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"faq-item\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button {...getToggleProps({ className: 'faq-question' })}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {question} {isOpen ? '−' : '+'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div {...getContentProps()} className=\"faq-answer\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {answer}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"radix-ui-模式\">Radix UI 模式</h2><p>Radix UI 是无头组件库的代表，它提供具有完整无障碍支持的无样式组件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import * as Dialog from &#39;@radix-ui/react-dialog&#39;;&#10;&#10;function ConfirmDialog({&#10;  title,&#10;  description,&#10;  onConfirm,&#10;  children,&#10;}: {&#10;  title: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  onConfirm: () =&gt; void;&#10;  children: React.ReactNode;&#10;}) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Dialog.Root&gt;&#10;      &lt;Dialog.Trigger asChild&gt;{children}&lt;/Dialog.Trigger&gt;&#10;      &lt;Dialog.Portal&gt;&#10;        &lt;Dialog.Overlay className=&quot;dialog-overlay&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;Dialog.Content className=&quot;dialog-content&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;Dialog.Title className=&quot;dialog-title&quot;&gt;{title}&lt;/Dialog.Title&gt;&#10;          &lt;Dialog.Description className=&quot;dialog-description&quot;&gt;{description}&lt;/Dialog.Description&gt;&#10;          &lt;div className=&quot;dialog-actions&quot;&gt;&#10;            &lt;Dialog.Close asChild&gt;&#10;              &lt;button className=&quot;btn-cancel&quot;&gt;取消&lt;/button&gt;&#10;            &lt;/Dialog.Close&gt;&#10;            &lt;button className=&quot;btn-confirm&quot; onClick={onConfirm}&gt;&#10;              确认&#10;            &lt;/button&gt;&#10;          &lt;/div&gt;&#10;          &lt;Dialog.Close asChild&gt;&#10;            &lt;button className=&quot;dialog-close&quot; aria-label=&quot;关闭&quot;&gt;&#10;              ✕&#10;            &lt;/button&gt;&#10;          &lt;/Dialog.Close&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Dialog.Content&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Dialog.Portal&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Dialog.Root&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Dialog from '@radix-ui/react-dialog';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ConfirmDialog({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  description,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onConfirm,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  description: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onConfirm: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children: React.ReactNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Dialog.Root></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Dialog.Trigger asChild>{children}&#x3C;/Dialog.Trigger></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Dialog.Portal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Dialog.Overlay className=\"dialog-overlay\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Dialog.Content className=\"dialog-content\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Dialog.Title className=\"dialog-title\">{title}&#x3C;/Dialog.Title></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Dialog.Description className=\"dialog-description\">{description}&#x3C;/Dialog.Description></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;div className=\"dialog-actions\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;Dialog.Close asChild></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;button className=\"btn-cancel\">取消&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/Dialog.Close></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;button className=\"btn-confirm\" onClick={onConfirm}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Dialog.Close asChild></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;button className=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"关闭\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              ✕</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/Dialog.Close></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Dialog.Content></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Dialog.Portal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Dialog.Root></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Dialog.Root (状态管理)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;Dialog.Trigger (触发器)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Dialog.Portal (传送门)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Dialog.Overlay (遮罩)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;Dialog.Content (内容)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Dialog.Title (标题)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;Dialog.Description (描述)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;Dialog.Close (关闭)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Dialog.Root (状态管理)\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"Dialog.Trigger (触发器)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Dialog.Portal (传送门)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Dialog.Overlay (遮罩)\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"Dialog.Content (内容)\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Dialog.Title (标题)\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"Dialog.Description (描述)\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"Dialog.Close (关闭)\"]</pre><p>Radix UI 的核心设计原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无样式</td>\n<td>只提供功能，样式由使用者定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可组合</td>\n<td>组件拆分为 Root、Trigger、Content 等子组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍优先</td>\n<td>自动管理焦点、键盘导航、ARIA 属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可控/非受控</td>\n<td>支持受控和非受控两种模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>asChild</td>\n<td>通过 <code>asChild</code> 将行为绑定到自定义元素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"无障碍内置\">无障碍内置</h2><p>无头组件的核心价值之一是<strong>内置无障碍支持</strong>。以 Select 为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import * as Select from &#39;@radix-ui/react-select&#39;;&#10;&#10;function LanguageSelect() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Select.Root defaultValue=&quot;zh&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;Select.Trigger className=&quot;select-trigger&quot; aria-label=&quot;选择语言&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;Select.Value placeholder=&quot;选择语言&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;Select.Icon&gt;▾&lt;/Select.Icon&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Select.Trigger&gt;&#10;      &lt;Select.Portal&gt;&#10;        &lt;Select.Content className=&quot;select-content&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;Select.Viewport&gt;&#10;            &lt;Select.Item value=&quot;zh&quot; className=&quot;select-item&quot;&gt;&#10;              &lt;Select.ItemText&gt;中文&lt;/Select.ItemText&gt;&#10;              &lt;Select.ItemIndicator&gt;✓&lt;/Select.ItemIndicator&gt;&#10;            &lt;/Select.Item&gt;&#10;            &lt;Select.Item value=&quot;en&quot; className=&quot;select-item&quot;&gt;&#10;              &lt;Select.ItemText&gt;English&lt;/Select.ItemText&gt;&#10;              &lt;Select.ItemIndicator&gt;✓&lt;/Select.ItemIndicator&gt;&#10;            &lt;/Select.Item&gt;&#10;            &lt;Select.Item value=&quot;ja&quot; className=&quot;select-item&quot;&gt;&#10;              &lt;Select.ItemText&gt;日本語&lt;/Select.ItemText&gt;&#10;              &lt;Select.ItemIndicator&gt;✓&lt;/Select.ItemIndicator&gt;&#10;            &lt;/Select.Item&gt;&#10;          &lt;/Select.Viewport&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Select.Content&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Select.Portal&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Select.Root&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Select from '@radix-ui/react-select';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function LanguageSelect() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Select.Root defaultValue=\"zh\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Select.Trigger className=\"select-trigger\" aria-label=\"选择语言\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Select.Value placeholder=\"选择语言\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Select.Icon>▾&#x3C;/Select.Icon></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Select.Trigger></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Select.Portal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Select.Content className=\"select-content\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Select.Viewport></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;Select.Item value=\"zh\" className=\"select-item\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;Select.ItemText>中文&#x3C;/Select.ItemText></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;Select.ItemIndicator>✓&#x3C;/Select.ItemIndicator></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/Select.Item></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;Select.Item value=\"en\" className=\"select-item\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;Select.ItemText>English&#x3C;/Select.ItemText></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;Select.ItemIndicator>✓&#x3C;/Select.ItemIndicator></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/Select.Item></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;Select.Item value=\"ja\" className=\"select-item\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;Select.ItemText>日本語&#x3C;/Select.ItemText></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;Select.ItemIndicator>✓&#x3C;/Select.ItemIndicator></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/Select.Item></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/Select.Viewport></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Select.Content></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Select.Portal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Select.Root></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>无头组件自动处理的无障碍特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>焦点管理</td>\n<td>打开时自动聚焦内容，关闭时返回触发器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>键盘导航</td>\n<td>上下箭头、Enter、Escape</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARIA 属性</td>\n<td><code>role</code>、<code>aria-expanded</code>、<code>aria-selected</code> 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕阅读器</td>\n<td>正确的 label 和 description 关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦点陷阱</td>\n<td>模态框内焦点不会逃出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"样式自由\">样式自由</h2><p>无头组件不绑定任何 CSS 方案，可以与任何样式工具搭配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// Tailwind CSS&#10;&lt;Dialog.Content className=&quot;fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;Dialog.Overlay className=&quot;fixed inset-0 bg-black/50&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;div className=&quot;bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-xl max-w-md w-full&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;Dialog.Title className=&quot;text-lg font-semibold&quot;&gt;标题&lt;/Dialog.Title&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/Dialog.Content&gt;&#10;&#10;// CSS Modules&#10;&lt;Dialog.Content className={styles.dialogContent}&gt;&#10;  &lt;Dialog.Overlay className={styles.overlay} /&gt;&#10;  &lt;Dialog.Title className={styles.title}&gt;标题&lt;/Dialog.Title&gt;&#10;&lt;/Dialog.Content&gt;&#10;&#10;// styled-components&#10;const StyledContent = styled(Dialog.Content)`&#10;  position: fixed;&#10;  background: white;&#10;  border-radius: 8px;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Tailwind CSS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Dialog.Content className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Dialog.Overlay className=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/50\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div className=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-xl max-w-md w-full\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Dialog.Title className=\"text-lg font-semibold\">标题&#x3C;/Dialog.Title></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/Dialog.Content></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// CSS Modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Dialog.Content className={styles.dialogContent}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Dialog.Overlay className={styles.overlay} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Dialog.Title className={styles.title}>标题&#x3C;/Dialog.Title></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/Dialog.Content></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// styled-components</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const StyledContent = styled(Dialog.Content)`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  position: fixed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  background: white;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  border-radius: 8px;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>`;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Radix UI + Tailwind CSS 是目前 React 社区非常流行的组合。shadcn/ui 就是基于这一组合构建的组件集合，可以直接复制到项目中使用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>无头组件</strong> 只提供逻辑和状态，不包含样式，使用者拥有完全的定制自由</li>\n<li><strong>Logic-Only Hooks</strong> 通过 props getter 模式将行为绑定到任意元素</li>\n<li><strong>Radix UI</strong> 是无头组件库的代表，提供完整的无障碍支持和可组合的 API</li>\n<li>无头组件自动管理焦点、键盘导航、ARIA 属性等无障碍特性</li>\n<li>可以与 Tailwind、CSS Modules、styled-components 等任何样式方案搭配使用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无头组件","id":"无头组件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是无头组件","id":"什么是无头组件"},{"level":2,"text":"Logic-Only Hooks","id":"logic-only-hooks"},{"level":3,"text":"使用方式","id":"使用方式"},{"level":2,"text":"Radix UI 模式","id":"radix-ui-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍内置","id":"无障碍内置"},{"level":2,"text":"样式自由","id":"样式自由"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Render Props 与 HOC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/render-props-and-hoc"},"next":{"title":"错误边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/error-boundaries"}}